## Proprietary binaries

The JAKA (节卡) jkrc SDK binaries (`jkrc.so`, `libjakaAPI.so`, pyV2.1.7.0)
are **not distributed with this repository** — they are licensed by JAKA and
may not be redistributed without JAKA's written permission. Each user
downloads them from the JAKA official download page and copies them into
`jaka_arm/jaka_sdk/<platform>/` (`aarch64-linux-gnu`, `x86_64-linux-gnu`,
`windows`); the directory is gitignored, and the loader in
`jaka_arm/jaka_sdk/__init__.py` picks the platform automatically.
`scripts/build.sh` fails fast with these instructions when the binaries are
missing.
